#: dtime.cpp:83
msgid "Set date and time &automatically:"
msgstr "Nastaj datum a čas awtomatisce:"

#: dtime.cpp:110
msgid "Here you can change the system date's day of the month, month and year."
msgstr "Tu móžeće systemowy datum změnić."

#: dtime.cpp:174
msgid ""
"Here you can change the system time. Click into the hours, minutes or "
"seconds field to change the relevant value, either using the up and down "
"buttons to the right or by entering a new value."
msgstr ""
"Tu móžeće systemowy čas nastajić. Klikńće na pola za hodźiny, mjeńšiny abo "
"sekundy, zo byšće wotpowědnu hódnotu změnili, pak z kneflomaj za \"horje\" "
"abo \"dele\" abo přez zapodaće noweje hódnoty."

